{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1688","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Manipulating History"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"As a human, she can erase history of its entirety. As a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Bai Ze (Hakutaku)"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", she can create history out of nothingness."}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"—"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Perfect Memento in Strict Sense"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Keine has the ability to manipulate history. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The history of Gensokyo is a string $$$s$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"of length $$$1$$$ initially"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". To fix the chaos caused by Yukari, she needs to do the following operations $$$n$$$ times, for the $$$i$$$-th time: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" She chooses a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"non-empty substring"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$t_{2i-1}$$$ of $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" She replaces $$$t_{2i-1}$$$ with a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"non-empty"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" string, $$$t_{2i}$$$. Note that the lengths of strings $$$t_{2i-1}$$$ and $$$t_{2i}$$$ can be different."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that if $$$t_{2i-1}$$$ occurs more than once in $$$s$$$, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly one"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of them will be replaced."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, let $$$s=$$$\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"marisa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", $$$t_{2i-1}=$$$\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and $$$t_{2i}=$$$\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". After the operation, $$$s$$$ becomes \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"mzrisa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" or \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"marisz"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After $$$n$$$ operations, Keine got the final string and an operation sequence $$$t$$$ of length $$$2n$$$. Just as Keine thinks she has finished, Yukari appears again and shuffles the order of $$$t$$$. Worse still, Keine forgets the initial history. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Keine find the initial history of Gensokyo!"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Recall that a substring is a sequence of consecutive characters of the string. For example, for string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" its substrings are: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ab"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"bc"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and some others. But the following strings are not its substring: \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ac"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cba"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"acb"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Hacks"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You cannot make hacks in this problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains a single integer $$$T$$$ ($$$1 \\leq T \\leq 10^3$$$) — the number of test cases. The description of the test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\lt 10 ^ 5$$$) — the number of operations."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next $$$2n$$$ lines contains one "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"non-empty"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" string $$$t_{i}$$$ — the $$$i$$$-th string of the shuffled sequence $$$t$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line contains one "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"non-empty"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" string $$$s$$$ — the final string."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the total length of given strings (including $$$t_i$$$ and $$$s$$$) over all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10 ^ 5$$$. All given strings consist of lowercase English letters only."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the initial string exists. It can be shown that the initial string is unique."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print the initial string in one line."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n2\na\nab\nb\ncd\nacd\n3\nz\na\na\naa\nyakumo\nran\nyakumoran\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\na\nz\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Test case 1:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initially $$$s$$$ is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" In the first operation, Keine chooses \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and replaces it with \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ab"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". $$$s$$$ becomes \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ab"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" In the second operation, Keine chooses \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and replaces it with \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". $$$s$$$ becomes \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"acd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"So the final string is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"acd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and $$$t=[$$$\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ab"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"cd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"$$$]$$$ before being shuffled."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Test case 2:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initially $$$s$$$ is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" In the first operation, Keine chooses \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and replaces it with \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". $$$s$$$ becomes \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" In the second operation, Keine chooses \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and replaces it with \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ran"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". $$$s$$$ becomes \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aran"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" In the third operation, Keine chooses \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and replaces it with \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yakumo"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". $$$s$$$ becomes \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yakumoran"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"So the final string is \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yakumoran"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and $$$t=[$$$\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"aa"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"ran"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yakumo"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"$$$]$$$ before being shuffled."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1688C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1688/problem/C"}